  "title": "Classic Caramel Corn",
  "description": "This easy caramel corn recipe makes a deliciously sweet and crunchy crowd-pleasing snack that's great for get togethers and gifting.",
  "authors": [
    "ARGO, KARO and FLEISCHMANN'S"
  ],
